<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5931] .NET: Incorrect conflicting type error</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5931</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Incorrect conflicting type error can occur when registering the same time from multiple threads simultaneously:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Conflicting type IDs [type1=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Row&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, type2=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Row&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, typeId=113114]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Marshaller.AddType&lt;/tt&gt; should check if existing type is the same as new one (as we do it in &lt;tt&gt;AddUserType&lt;/tt&gt;, see other usages of &lt;tt&gt;ThrowConflictingTypeError&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13092447">IGNITE-5931</key>
            <summary>.NET: Incorrect conflicting type error</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
